    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b3f41fc431e71e726672c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我真高兴啊。那么再一次，今后请多关照！\n……看着我跑步的身姿，直到看到厌为止♪　呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93283980b619fcd2c48349eb128e4a342ead4ee2224bdd3b3730a303e84d50d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
