    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7b6151dced89c3453821ff9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她灿烂的笑容充满了希望。\r\n她圆圆的双眼中，确实映出了一个“大人”――",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c04f789461da85ebaafc5fdc80bb50117c00e4f1ccb056f772ec4049723949a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
