    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fef26a885d382ebd591718c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，我同平常是开朗大方的『姐姐』，站在草地上时\r\n比任何人都爱赛跑的她的每一天开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87c59ffc2f2116455c8531b2705c4fe5b84253a229ef2a3d1e5e8585cadaebeb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
