      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多项目竞技大赛，草地2400m开始了！\n艾尼斯风神，漂亮地起跑位于领先位置！",
      "source_fingerprint": "149b0b076dca1177421591b2aa113241367a4370b7288f44cc13964497077586",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:085933f64434dde31949cde7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "闪闪发光！你就是训练员",
